      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 12.82,
      "end_seconds": 16.82,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What seems to be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 18.17,
      "end_seconds": 23.4,
      "duration_seconds": 5.23,
      "text": "Well, I've been having pain under the right ribs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.2,
      "end_seconds": 32.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "Right, what's the timeline, when did it begin?"
