      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.19,
      "end_seconds": 43.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Is it bearing on you a lot?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.07,
      "end_seconds": 46.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "I'd say moderate."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.45,
      "end_seconds": 64.73,
      "duration_seconds": 7.28,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any reduced baby movements, leaking fluid or vaginal bleeding?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.42,
      "end_seconds": 69.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "No, I'd have said so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.18,
      "end_seconds": 73.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "Any muscle or joint problems besides this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.04,
      "end_seconds": 76.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "No, joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.73,
      "end_seconds": 79.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.55,
      "end_seconds": 92.82,
      "duration_seconds": 12.27,
      "text": "Nothing, I'm teetotal. I quit smoking around ten years ago. I hardly move around during the day. I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.33,
      "end_seconds": 111.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.36,
      "end_seconds": 117.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "I've had heart failure for about a year now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.32,
      "end_seconds": 129.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "Okay, before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.47,
      "end_seconds": 134.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "No, nothing as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.4,
      "end_seconds": 138.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.18,
      "end_seconds": 142.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "No, not at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.06,
      "end_seconds": 146.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Any regular medication, tablets or creams?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.13,
      "end_seconds": 153.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "No, nothing at the moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.84,
      "end_seconds": 158.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.1,
      "end_seconds": 173.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.74,
      "end_seconds": 192.31,
      "duration_seconds": 6.57,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 15, pulse is 76 beats a minute, blood pressure 168 over 97."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.55,
      "end_seconds": 198.83,
      "duration_seconds": 5.28,
      "text": "Alright, I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.62,
      "end_seconds": 201.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "Nearly finished here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.4,
      "end_seconds": 222.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "text": "Your blood pressure is very high and your reflexes are brisk."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.99,
      "end_seconds": 228.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.15,
      "end_seconds": 251.78,
      "duration_seconds": 9.63,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. I think we're dealing with severe pre-eclampsia at this stage. I'll request urgent blood tests, it'll help with pre-eclampsia."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 253.55,
      "end_seconds": 257.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "I can book that for Tuesday at 9 am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.62,
      "end_seconds": 272.9,
      "duration_seconds": 14.28,
      "text": "Let's use labetalol, 200 milligrams, once now, single dose. That's for severe hypertension. You need to go to the maternity unit straight away. I think the obstetric team should see you too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 276.78,
      "end_seconds": 277.48,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.25,
      "end_seconds": 284.22,
      "duration_seconds": 5.97,
      "text": "Do get help quickly if the symptoms get worse. Book a review straight away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 285.21,
      "end_seconds": 288.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "I'll book it on my way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.97,
      "end_seconds": 296.59,
      "duration_seconds": 7.62,
      "text": "Can you tell me the plan back in your own words, so I know I've explained it clearly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 298.43,
      "end_seconds": 308.13,
      "duration_seconds": 9.7,
      "text": "So, I take the labetalol, 200 milligrams, once now and come back straight away. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.84,
      "end_seconds": 316.55,
      "duration_seconds": 6.71,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 317.39,
      "end_seconds": 319.83,
